#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut18_checks
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  430
#! poster  290
#! crop    0 0 1100 680
#! keys
# keys that respect the focus: Result's tab is clicked, right moves its probe line a node at a time; the title field
# is clicked and edited, right moves the field's cursor and the probe line stays; escape; the pointer rests on Run,
# whose tooltip shows F5; F5, pressed with the focus elsewhere, runs the solver
0   move 600 300
20  move 456 31 15
40  down
41  up
70  key right
82  key right
94  key right
106 key right
130 move 200 86 15
150 down
151 up
165 key end
175 text  B
195 key right
215 key escape
235 move 383 384 15
300 move 600 250 10
320 key f5
